<div class="kicker"><span class="dash"></span> CODE HEALTH</div><div class="hero"><div><h1>Complexity analysis</h1><p>Find branching-heavy functions in imported JavaScript revisions.</p></div>
<form method="post"><button class="primary" <%= Number(stats.pending)===0?'disabled':'' %>><svg><use href="/icons.svg#pulse"/></svg>Run analysis</button></form></div>
<section class="panel"><span class="overline">DETERMINISTIC RULE · V1</span><h2>Flag functions scoring 6 or higher</h2><p class="sub">Start at 1 per function. Add 1 for each decision, loop, catch, non-default switch case, ternary, or logical operator. Nested functions are scored separately.</p><div class="stats-line"><span><b><%= stats.pending %></b> pending</span><span><b><%= stats.analyzed %></b> analyzed</span><span><b><%= stats.skipped %></b> skipped</span></div><small>Each run checks up to 15 changed .js, .cjs, or .mjs files. Deleted files are excluded.</small></section>
<section class="panel table-panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Stored warnings</h2><span class="pill"><%= warnings.length %> findings</span></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Function / file</th><th>Score</th><th>Commit</th><th>Author</th><th>Authored (UTC)</th></tr></thead><tbody><% for(const w of warnings){ %><tr><td><b><%= w.function_name %></b><small class="path"><%= w.path %>#L<%= w.line %></small></td><td><span class="pill warn"><%= w.score %></span></td><td><a class="sha" href="<%= base %>/history?q=<%= w.sha %>"><%= short(w.sha) %></a></td><td><%= w.display_name %></td><td class="date"><%= dt(w.authored_at) %></td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></div><% if(!warnings.length){ %><p class="empty">No stored warnings. Run analysis on pending revisions to check them.</p><% } %></section>
<% if(skips.length){ %><section class="panel"><h2>Skipped revisions</h2><% for(const s of skips){ %><p><code><%= s.path %> @ <%= short(s.sha) %></code> · <%= s.skip_reason %></p><% } %></section><% } %>
